WEBVTT

00:00.870 --> 00:02.690
Cuckoo!

00:04.470 --> 00:06.790
That again, Adashino-kun?

00:06.790 --> 00:08.990
Sumireko-san, did you know?

00:09.330 --> 00:13.200
In Europe, the number of times 
you hear a cuckoo cry

00:13.200 --> 00:16.500
is said to foretell the number 
of years until your wedding.

00:16.500 --> 00:21.390
In that case, I've heard it three times, 
so I'll be married three years from now.

00:21.390 --> 00:23.750
You're welcome to send an extravagant gift.

00:23.750 --> 00:26.880
Cuckoo! Cuckoo!

00:26.880 --> 00:31.170
Hey! Who said you could delay my wedding?!

00:31.170 --> 00:33.640
Seriously, you call that foretelling?

00:33.640 --> 00:35.520
It's basically a curse!

00:35.520 --> 00:37.650
Speaking of curses, that reminds me...

00:37.650 --> 00:40.640
I heard that Uname-sensei 
is going back to work.

00:40.640 --> 00:44.520
Yeah. I hope nothing further happens.

00:44.520 --> 00:45.650
Excuse me, I—

00:47.580 --> 00:49.430
Are you all right, miss?

00:49.770 --> 00:51.410
Ow...

00:51.410 --> 00:52.830
Uname-sensei?

00:52.830 --> 00:56.410
It <i>is</i> you! So you do work here, 
Wakazukuri-san!

00:56.720 --> 00:59.410
It's no wonder I thought 
you looked familiar.

01:00.040 --> 01:01.920
What brings you here?

01:05.470 --> 01:08.920
I'm so sorry for causing you so much trouble!

01:09.320 --> 01:14.430
If the two of you hadn't stopped me, I might 
have done something I could never take back!

01:14.430 --> 01:18.980
Thank you, truly. It's like an evil spirit 
has been banished from me.

01:20.940 --> 01:24.830
From now on, I'll work to eliminate bullying 
with my own efforts, not some amulet.

01:25.440 --> 01:28.440
That's my new dream.

01:28.440 --> 01:30.950
<b></b>Ogawa

01:28.440 --> 01:30.950
And, um... Ogawa-san, is it?

01:32.050 --> 01:34.200
You should work toward 
writing that novel, too!

01:34.740 --> 01:36.040
Well, I'll see you later!

01:39.760 --> 01:42.420
Sumireko-san, do you have tomorrow off?

01:42.420 --> 01:45.190
I intend to spend it devoting 
myself to writing.

01:45.830 --> 01:47.960
Cuckoo!

01:48.910 --> 01:50.010
Stop it.

01:54.590 --> 01:59.390
<b>Mysterious Disappearances</b>

01:54.590 --> 01:59.390
<b>Mysterious Disappearances</b>

03:21.470 --> 03:26.850
<b>A Bath, Cleaning, and a Surprise</b>

03:21.470 --> 03:26.850
<b>A Bath, Cleaning, and a Surprise</b>

03:39.990 --> 03:42.320
<i>What're you doing, Oto-san?</i>

03:45.000 --> 03:46.680
Are you imitating an anime?

03:46.680 --> 03:48.630
Don't laugh at me!

03:49.330 --> 03:51.940
I'm sorry, Ren-nii! Are you all right?

03:51.940 --> 03:54.350
Yes, I'm fine.

03:55.230 --> 03:58.400
Shouldn't you have the old man look at that?

03:58.400 --> 04:01.010
Well, yes, but...

04:01.010 --> 04:02.800
Okay! I've decided!

04:03.180 --> 04:04.010
Oto.

04:04.490 --> 04:06.350
Go and get ready for a sleepover.

04:08.210 --> 04:09.640
A sleepover?

04:14.360 --> 04:17.430
Who in the world are you two?

04:21.510 --> 04:26.030
Oh, right. For everyone else, 
this is sakura-viewing season.

04:32.980 --> 04:34.650
Inspiration strikes!

04:36.520 --> 04:40.690
I'll go to a convenience store to buy some 
alcohol and admire the sakura from here.

04:40.690 --> 04:42.390
A solo viewing!

04:42.720 --> 04:44.560
That might just work.

04:44.920 --> 04:46.220
Oh, it'll work for sure!

05:12.070 --> 05:14.250
You're still here?

05:14.770 --> 05:15.840
Are you a stray?

05:20.330 --> 05:22.260
I'm fully stocked!

05:37.450 --> 05:39.470
Everything is in place!

05:54.820 --> 05:58.380
Drinking while it's still light out 
and writing a novel...

05:58.380 --> 06:00.380
<b>"This town has a lot of '!' Markers," he said.
They are evidence that something out of the ordinary has happened.
Ordinary people can't see these Markers, but this brother and sister...</b>

05:58.380 --> 06:00.380
This is the best!

06:06.390 --> 06:07.490
Huh?

06:08.390 --> 06:10.920
Wait... What?

06:19.150 --> 06:21.650
You little...

06:39.100 --> 06:42.170
You oversexed kappa...

06:50.510 --> 06:52.180
<b>Adashi</b>

06:50.510 --> 06:52.180
Do you have a moment,
Sumireko-san?

06:53.680 --> 06:55.690
What's wrong? I'm not
lending you any money.

06:55.680 --> 06:58.180
What's wrong? I'm not
lending you any money.

06:55.690 --> 06:58.180
You're one to talk, drinking
that cheap, low-malt beer.

06:55.690 --> 06:58.190
<b>Adashi</b>

06:58.180 --> 07:00.190
What's wrong? I'm not
lending you any money.

06:58.180 --> 07:00.190
<b>Adashi</b>

06:58.180 --> 07:00.190
You're one to talk, drinking
that cheap, low-malt beer.

06:58.190 --> 07:00.190
Huh? Are you watching me
or something?

07:00.190 --> 07:01.190
<b>Adashi</b>

07:00.190 --> 07:01.190
You're one to talk, drinking
that cheap, low-malt beer.

07:00.190 --> 07:01.190
Huh? Are you watching me
or something?

07:00.190 --> 07:01.190
<b>Adashi</b>

07:00.190 --> 07:01.190
Just a hunch.

07:01.190 --> 07:03.690
<b>Adashi</b>

07:01.190 --> 07:03.690
Huh? Are you watching me
or something?

07:01.190 --> 07:03.690
<b>Adashi</b>

07:01.190 --> 07:03.690
Just a hunch.

07:01.190 --> 07:03.690
<b>Adashi</b>

07:01.190 --> 07:03.690
More importantly,
I have a favor to ask you.

07:03.940 --> 07:06.440
This is pretty sudden.
Is there a problem?

07:06.440 --> 07:08.690
This is pretty sudden.
Is there a problem?

07:06.450 --> 07:08.690
<b>Adashi</b>

07:06.450 --> 07:08.700
I need to be away for a while
to attend to certain affairs.

07:08.690 --> 07:12.200
This is pretty sudden.
Is there a problem?

07:08.690 --> 07:12.200
<b>Adashi</b>

07:08.690 --> 07:12.200
I need to be away for a while
to attend to certain affairs.

07:08.700 --> 07:12.200
Thus, I was hoping you could look
after Oto for two or three days.

07:08.700 --> 07:12.200
<b>Adashi</b>

07:11.050 --> 07:12.200
Huh?!

07:12.450 --> 07:17.210
<b>Adashi</b>

07:12.450 --> 07:17.210
Kindly direct your attention
toward your front door.

07:18.710 --> 07:20.480
Oh, come on.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.220
Surprise.

07:26.470 --> 07:30.720
<b>Adashi</b>

07:26.470 --> 07:30.720
I'm counting on you!!

07:29.280 --> 07:30.720
That jerk!

07:35.310 --> 07:40.260
So... could you explain to me 
what exactly is going on?

07:44.660 --> 07:49.740
Ren-nii got hurt during the ushi-oni 
incident, so he needs treatment.

07:49.740 --> 07:52.920
I see. That does sound rough.

07:52.920 --> 07:55.750
Wait, do you two have health care?

07:58.310 --> 08:00.750
Sorry! I won't pry any further, okay?

08:02.070 --> 08:05.310
It's all right. You can stay 
as long as you like.

08:05.650 --> 08:08.260
Make yourself at home and relax!

08:08.710 --> 08:10.240
Apartment wife...

08:17.240 --> 08:18.570
Thank you.

08:19.860 --> 08:21.970
But I don't want to stay in a pigsty.

08:21.970 --> 08:24.920
Sometimes the things you say are super harsh.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.260
Still...

08:26.620 --> 08:27.740
I see what you mean.

08:27.740 --> 08:28.490
What?

08:28.490 --> 08:30.280
It's time for some spring cleaning!

08:30.280 --> 08:31.780
Help me out, Oto-chan!

08:31.780 --> 08:32.530
What?!

08:32.530 --> 08:34.820
I've dug my own grave!

08:47.310 --> 08:49.560
Ten trash bags full...

08:49.560 --> 08:51.210
I think that should do it.

08:51.800 --> 08:55.840
And yet, for some strange reason, 
it doesn't feel like we've cleaned up at all!

08:55.840 --> 08:57.310
What is wrong with this place?!

08:58.440 --> 09:00.810
Thanks for helping, Oto-chan.

09:00.810 --> 09:04.860
It's nothing. I wasn't any 
help in the first place.

09:04.860 --> 09:07.500
Do you have a change of 
underwear in your things?

09:07.500 --> 09:08.240
Yes.

09:08.240 --> 09:09.470
And a towel?

09:09.470 --> 09:10.430
No.

09:10.430 --> 09:12.770
Then I'll lend you one of mine.

09:12.770 --> 09:16.240
We've worked up a good sweat. 
Next, it's time to freshen up!

09:17.160 --> 09:18.540
"Freshen up"?

09:19.830 --> 09:21.710
<b>Tomi Baths</b>

09:23.000 --> 09:25.500
<b>Baths</b>

09:23.000 --> 09:25.500
<b></b>Vending Machines

09:23.430 --> 09:25.090
It's so big.

09:27.630 --> 09:31.970
<i>That's Occhan... and I feel like I've seen 
the person with her somewhere before.</i>

09:31.970 --> 09:33.510
Well, let's head in.

09:36.270 --> 09:37.690
Welcome!

09:38.080 --> 09:39.640
Two adults, please.

09:39.640 --> 09:40.190
Of course.

09:40.190 --> 09:41.510
Should I undress here?

09:41.510 --> 09:44.230
Sure. Use whichever locker you like.

09:49.560 --> 09:51.040
Here. Your towel.

09:51.040 --> 09:51.980
Okay.

09:51.980 --> 09:54.570
Is this your first time at a public bath?

09:54.570 --> 09:55.300
Yes.

10:06.780 --> 10:08.830
Why don't we go get in the bath?

10:13.680 --> 10:19.740
So do you live with your brother 
in that defunct station?

10:19.740 --> 10:21.270
Well, yes.

10:21.270 --> 10:22.670
Just the two of you?

10:22.670 --> 10:24.310
Well, yes.

10:24.730 --> 10:27.340
What do you usually do about baths and stuff?

10:27.340 --> 10:29.820
We do what we need to do.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.900
So, apartment wife...

10:31.900 --> 10:32.850
Hmm?

10:32.850 --> 10:36.710
You have a bath in your apartment, 
so why did you come here today?

10:36.710 --> 10:40.420
Since you're here, I thought it'd be better 
to go somewhere with a bit more space.

10:42.290 --> 10:47.470
The tub in my prefab bathroom is pretty small.
I always have to squeeze myself in.

10:47.470 --> 10:53.020
Though now that I can shrink to child size, 
I can stretch my legs out more.

10:54.740 --> 10:58.340
Couldn't you just lose some 
of that excess weight instead?

10:58.340 --> 11:02.750
Stop right there. One more word,
and you'll open up a huge can of worms.

11:29.790 --> 11:34.030
My chest still hurts where you 
hit me for no reason at all.

11:36.090 --> 11:39.140
I'd like to buy some of these to 
thank you for letting me stay,

11:39.140 --> 11:40.780
but I don't have any money.

11:40.780 --> 11:42.640
I'll buy them for you, Oto-chan.

11:42.950 --> 11:46.390
You gotta drink coffee 
milk after a bath, right?

11:49.400 --> 11:50.300
Here.

11:57.200 --> 11:59.530
Fruit milk tastes better.

11:59.530 --> 12:03.410
Don't complain when you're 
the one being treated, okay?

12:05.770 --> 12:10.420
Now, let's go eat dinner somewhere. 
What do you want?

12:13.400 --> 12:14.420
Ramen.

12:14.420 --> 12:17.970
Huh. So you like ramen?

12:18.390 --> 12:19.430
Yes.

12:19.830 --> 12:22.260
All right. Let's eat ramen.

12:25.930 --> 12:28.440
<b>Baths</b>

12:25.930 --> 12:28.440
<b></b>Vending Machines

12:28.880 --> 12:30.040
<i>They left.</i>

12:31.170 --> 12:35.260
<i>That means Occhan's underwear 
is in Occhan's backpack right now.</i>

12:35.260 --> 12:36.440
<i>Not to mention...</i>

12:36.440 --> 12:40.350
<i>In the bag of that older woman I've seen 
somewhere but can't quite place...</i>

12:40.950 --> 12:45.450
<i>are the sexy undergarments of an older woman 
I've seen somewhere but can't quite place!</i>

12:47.020 --> 12:47.950
<i>I want to see them!</i>

12:51.820 --> 12:52.530
Mari.

12:52.530 --> 12:53.450
Y-Yes?

12:53.450 --> 12:57.180
I'm going home for a bit.
Look after the front desk, would you?

12:57.180 --> 12:58.350
Will do!

13:25.040 --> 13:26.620
Hey, you there!

13:27.090 --> 13:29.160
What're you doing in a place like this?

13:29.160 --> 13:31.620
You shouldn't be here.

13:32.710 --> 13:35.790
Old man! Long time no see!

13:35.790 --> 13:37.320
Adashino-kun?

13:41.550 --> 13:43.260
I've been looking for you!

13:44.620 --> 13:46.810
Hey! Give me a break, would you?

13:46.810 --> 13:49.950
If you shout like that, the folks 
upstairs are gonna notice!

13:49.950 --> 13:51.030
Ow! Ow!

13:51.410 --> 13:55.120
You know this really isn't a place 
where people should be.

13:55.120 --> 13:59.530
I'm saying this for your own good. 
Just head back home, Adashino-kun.

14:00.290 --> 14:03.530
Can I take that to mean you 
don't want the gift I brought?

14:03.530 --> 14:07.530
I've been waiting for you, Adashino-kun! 
You are so very welcome here!

14:10.120 --> 14:11.790
Ah, that's the good stuff.

14:11.790 --> 14:13.790
You sure like to be unhealthy.

14:14.040 --> 14:17.250
Next time, will you bring me 
some cigars and whisky?

14:17.250 --> 14:19.800
I thought I wasn't supposed to come here.

14:19.800 --> 14:24.120
You aren't. You shouldn't. But if you're 
coming anyway, then I'll be counting on you.

14:24.470 --> 14:25.730
All right.

14:25.730 --> 14:26.800
Now, then...

14:26.800 --> 14:29.400
Let's get down to business.

14:29.740 --> 14:32.750
Certificates of residence, insurance cards, 
official copies of family registers,

14:32.750 --> 14:35.900
bank accounts, passports... 
I have more or less everything.

14:35.900 --> 14:37.330
I have My Number cards, too.

14:37.330 --> 14:39.320
I guarantee their authenticity.

14:39.320 --> 14:40.670
What do you want?

14:43.610 --> 14:44.820
Hold on a minute.

14:45.550 --> 14:47.710
Could it be that you've used your Eyes?

14:50.280 --> 14:52.480
Don't tell me I hit the nail on the head.

14:53.260 --> 14:55.330
Didn't I tell you not to use them?

14:56.220 --> 15:00.780
The more you use them, the more 
those Eyes will destroy your body.

15:00.780 --> 15:04.250
You'll die before you can 
even send your sister home.

15:05.720 --> 15:07.500
Even so, I had to do it!

15:08.030 --> 15:09.600
There isn't any time left.

15:13.830 --> 15:17.330
Let me see your eyes for a sec. 
That's why you came here, right?

15:17.330 --> 15:18.360
Old man...

15:19.360 --> 15:20.480
Let's see.

15:21.850 --> 15:24.990
Ugh! Whoa! That's gruesome!

15:25.320 --> 15:28.070
Okay, I get it. That's enough.

15:28.070 --> 15:29.490
<i>That's not reassuring.</i>

15:29.490 --> 15:29.490
<b>N</b>

15:29.490 --> 15:31.990
<b>I</b>

15:29.490 --> 15:31.990
<b>T</b>

15:29.490 --> 15:31.990
<b>O</b>

15:29.490 --> 15:31.990
<b>R</b>

15:29.490 --> 15:31.990
<b>A</b>

15:29.490 --> 15:31.990
<b>N</b>

15:34.480 --> 15:36.800
Okay, don't hold back. Eat your fill!

15:40.180 --> 15:41.750
I will, thank you.

15:54.300 --> 15:57.270
Hey, Oto-chan, where did you come here from?

16:00.060 --> 16:02.270
Where did <i>you</i> come here from?

16:02.590 --> 16:08.630
I didn't really... come here, per se.

16:08.630 --> 16:10.530
I moved out of my parents' house, that's all.

16:11.450 --> 16:13.710
I came from over that way.

16:13.710 --> 16:15.560
That way? Where?

16:15.930 --> 16:17.040
I couldn't say.

16:17.960 --> 16:20.540
Do you have any family besides your brother?

16:21.370 --> 16:23.760
Do <i>you</i> have family?

16:23.760 --> 16:25.480
I do, back where I grew up.

16:27.600 --> 16:30.300
I do, too, where I grew up.

16:31.330 --> 16:34.570
Adashino-kun was talking about 
sending you back or something.

16:34.570 --> 16:36.540
What did he mean?

16:37.840 --> 16:38.860
Oto-chan?

16:41.830 --> 16:44.320
Did I rub her the wrong way?

16:45.340 --> 16:46.850
Apartment wife...

16:46.850 --> 16:47.820
Yes?

16:47.820 --> 16:50.060
Can I get another serving of noodles?

16:51.780 --> 16:54.670
I'm amazed you've kept your sanity.

16:55.060 --> 16:58.150
I'll take you along with me, 
but it's just a temporary respite.

16:58.150 --> 16:59.830
Thank you.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.730
There's no need to rush.

17:04.990 --> 17:08.460
I think you're probably going 
to find more Curiosities here.

17:08.930 --> 17:12.290
After all, this is a new neighborhood.

17:13.970 --> 17:17.970
In a way, this area is like a blank slate.

17:17.970 --> 17:20.480
And in every new place,

17:21.020 --> 17:23.980
new gods come to dwell.

17:24.380 --> 17:27.770
So just relax a little more,

17:27.770 --> 17:29.570
and take your time getting there.

17:30.310 --> 17:34.330
With a face as scary as that, 
your little sister's gonna hate you.

17:37.490 --> 17:39.290
Now, shall we go?

17:39.600 --> 17:40.650
Yes.

17:45.000 --> 17:48.000
<b>Simply Walk Alone,
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hLike a Rhino's Horn</b>

17:56.040 --> 17:58.520
When you feel like sleeping, 
you can use that bed.

17:58.520 --> 18:03.020
<b>Simply Walk Alone,
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hLike a Rhino's Horn</b>

17:58.520 --> 18:03.020
<b>Winner of the Newcomer's Award</b>

17:58.520 --> 18:03.020
<b>Ogawa Sumireko</b>

17:58.900 --> 18:03.020
Ren-nii said you were the author of this book.

18:03.880 --> 18:07.520
I wrote it when I was fifteen. 
It's my only published work.

18:07.520 --> 18:08.930
Fifteen?

18:08.930 --> 18:10.680
Meaning I was young.

18:11.530 --> 18:13.530
That's the same age I am now.

18:14.340 --> 18:15.530
Really?

18:16.010 --> 18:19.920
Well, I'm not the kind of person 
who'd be jealous of youth.

18:36.030 --> 18:37.640
She falls asleep fast!

18:45.610 --> 18:48.550
Really, who are you and Adashino-kun?

19:21.110 --> 19:22.350
<i>Ren-nii?</i>

19:28.540 --> 19:29.910
<i>Ren-nii!</i>

20:03.610 --> 20:05.400
Morning, Oto-chan!

20:05.400 --> 20:06.710
Apartment wife.

20:10.400 --> 20:12.420
You haven't eaten it yet?

20:13.900 --> 20:18.810
It's thanks for the food you gave me before. 
At least, it was meant to be.

20:18.810 --> 20:23.200
I have to go to school, so I'd like 
to eat a little more than this.

20:27.560 --> 20:30.860
I'm kidding, I'm kidding! 
I bought us breakfast.

20:47.290 --> 20:51.730
"In the heavens, the sun and moon shine. 
 You are like them in my thoughts,

20:52.910 --> 20:56.740
and I regret that with each 
new day, you grow older."

21:00.670 --> 21:02.430
Um, I need the restroom.

21:02.430 --> 21:04.060
Oh, sorry!

21:05.310 --> 21:05.900
Huh?

21:05.900 --> 21:08.240
Sorry to keep you waiting! I'm all ready!

21:08.240 --> 21:10.210
Let's go together today, shall we?

21:10.210 --> 21:11.670
G-Go where?

21:11.670 --> 21:13.200
To school, of course!

21:13.200 --> 21:14.470
What? B-But...

21:14.470 --> 21:16.710
The bathroom's free. Go on!

21:18.040 --> 21:20.660
Before, we were caught up in 
all that stuff with the Curiosity,

21:20.660 --> 21:25.220
so even though I got to be a high 
schooler again, I didn't get to enjoy it.

21:25.220 --> 21:28.250
D-Don't you have a novel to write?

21:28.250 --> 21:30.000
No need to worry!

21:30.000 --> 21:34.230
I plan to gather material as 
I enjoy the fruits of adolescence!

23:34.980 --> 23:40.640
<b>Underwear, Snacks, and Scarlet Clothes</b>

23:35.720 --> 23:39.940
Next time: "Underwear, Snacks, 
and Scarlet Clothes."
